1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Please unfold the meeting rug.
Our cabinet is humming again.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,800
- Is it humming in a major key?
- The fog kind.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,000
<i>I brought a tuning fork.</i>

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,200
Finch, that fork
is made of wax.

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:17,400
I collect jars of fog
and I label them by pitch.

6
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:20,300
That's what fog choir
practice is for.

7
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,600
[LAUGHS]

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,100
I can hear it through my hat.

9
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,900
Your hat has a built-in trumpet.

10
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,000
The trumpet is purely ceremonial.

11
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:33,600
This rug is calling
for a recess.

12
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,200
- Lumen, the rug has a vote.
- It keeps voting for Thursdays!

13
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:38,400
Motion to fold the rug!

14
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,000
